{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026szpGVRpq6r1792717284.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美股個別發展，港股料反彈高開。在AI融資憂慮及中東局勢惡化下，納指跌2%至月低，費半跌6%，道指微升。</p><p></p><p><strong>AI融資與科技股</strong></p><p></p><p>Meta支出承諾提高；黃仁勳表示，新雲端公司缺資金拖增長。</p><p></p><p><strong>商品、債息與中美投資限制</strong></p><p></p><p>油價上升，布油逾五個月高；金急跌2%；美10年期債息一個月來首跌穿5厘。另外，美擬限制對華生物技術投資。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:05:20.175966+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T00:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:58:12.719140+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T02:58:06.421324+00:00","content_hash":"c9916a1255ce80c5f06456bba3aeb8ebc40eae7f6bb35a41164e55afc900c51d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:05:20.175966+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}